          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "The Quintessential Quintuplets: Gotopazu Story",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Gotopazu, the October 27, 2020-released smartphone game based on The Quintessential Quintuplets, comes to consoles in the form of memorial stories. The console version is developed by MAGES., developers of The Quintessential Quintuplets ∬: Summer Memories Also Come in Five and The Quintessential Quintuplets the Movie: Five Memories of My Time with You. It features the first year’s worth of memorial stories from Gotopazu for all five quintuplets, fully voiced across 24 volumes. There are also over 500 illustrations. And the Illustration Book Set editions are a must-have item for diehard fans.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Gotopazu, el juego para teléfonos inteligentes lanzado el 27 de octubre de 2020 y basado en The Quintessential Quintuplets, llega a consolas en forma de historias conmemorativas. La versión para consola está desarrollada por MAGES., desarrolladora de The Quintessential Quintuplets ∬: Summer Memories Also Come in Five y The Quintessential Quintuplets the Movie: Five Memories of My Time with You. Incluye el primer año de historias conmemorativas de Gotopazu para las cinco quintillizas, con voces completas en 24 volúmenes. También hay más de 500 ilustraciones. Además, las ediciones con el set de libros de ilustraciones son un objeto imprescindible para los fans más acérrimos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2023",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
