        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Quintessential Quintuplets: Five Promises Made with Her is the third The Quintessential Quintuplets romance visual novel developed by MAGES. The theme this time is “heart-pounding summer vacation dates.” As for what kind of story will unfold this time, more information will be shared in future announcements.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "The Quintessential Quintuplets: Five Promises Made with Her es la tercera novela visual romántica de The Quintessential Quintuplets, desarrollada por MAGES. El tema esta vez son «citas de vacaciones de verano que aceleran el corazón». Sobre el tipo de historia que se desarrollará, se compartirá más información en futuros anuncios.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
